{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30002_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:501c06e0562cb25a4ec3ea8949a28be610e2dc319ec950700948d258f2fa26e3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d08dd55d57c5ecf0bb4170d8a3b0c9d843fcc86527149778c74f758dd7661b6c",
      "text": "归还的笔记本",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6a5f698982d6f70b4279c304629b1f6e6de6200ed5f132b1a0f2724a43e0e27",
      "text": "为了挖出时间胶囊，S.E.M来到了以前任教的\n学校。道夫在那里发现了一本曾经的学生留下的笔记本。\n为了将那本笔记中书写的故事化为现实，\n三人决定挑战拍摄电视剧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序幕",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d08dd55d57c5ecf0bb4170d8a3b0c9d843fcc86527149778c74f758dd7661b6c",
      "text": "归还的笔记本",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000013:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57a5677bb622a8c6358f1366e1c8b394fb039ac527e934c50768c1ad54acdacf",
      "text": "数年前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c25f9998655432b55ad1cb2ea2ee4b779689213e2a22a479dd5b290c396e861c",
      "text": "……喂，你看过这本漫画了吗？\n超级有意思的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67294e8e33a8255b2bb60de74996c2216bc249d627303a11d754429735c504ce",
      "text": "真的假的？那我等下看看。\n反正上课也无聊得很。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2fa41450e26204faeede456e2f88432c864863632c18e6c6972b13fce272214",
      "text": "……你们几位，现在是数学课时间。\n请把与上课无关的东西收起来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60825aea7212c457ef00f8a2c9b85697e7466669089cc092df94c7d64233f3b7",
      "text": "（面对学生，教师型机器人硲大声呐喊！\n然而……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b0c985f28f58aa52faa19fb5982093a6407f7937ba9e7208604a770f954d7c5",
      "text": "哎——有什么关系嘛。\n新来的老师一边凉快去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bfe9a68cf861107fd9c60d1aab7dd346f3226d4e6b0d8d667339457c1ecac7b",
      "text": "（那呐喊声，没能触动任何人的心弦……这样。\n好，这故事写得相当有趣嘛）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:012ed3fb5a28385358badedc1ece0deed5a5d04d01fd624e5d492d77e5ec9327",
      "text": "（……果然，今天还是不行吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ada6d6869fa39f83e06636ba44c7558a68a3e18f5d6bc4518cfa79b272e6fb3",
      "text": "（作为教师，我明明只是想把学生们\n引向正确的方向而已）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ba6bce94585d324fc2f5d887c8adf866c7a7a10c8c30c7e56e0dfd6e4278b7b",
      "text": "（不论我花多少心思，\n我的课堂都引不起他们的兴趣）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36f45b24db912158b6d806d8d535975ce72863e7036b27dbd36945d99883cc89",
      "text": "（……但我绝不放弃。\n一定有某种好办法才对）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_b:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5474a516c4ac74b2edb52dbdd20657a6862648428b6bc19d4209d1e1e3edbf5e",
      "text": "高中校舍前",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a03260d8ca2ebc7b5961188b884b8f7a87ebae33bfdeaf6a667e0d3d28fa2ed",
      "text": "Mr. 硲、Mr. 山下。\n好久没来这里了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b69cea217f7b8830d12cef9aaf916fcc0789d40e77c90c2987b15e5ba70af26",
      "text": "挖Time capsule，\n我超级期待的☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4653ab5fdbd81941f5dc79556e6866b74ff2ec3c3095aae3e49583b0e7bd012",
      "text": "这样啊，类是第一次来吗。\n我可是好久没来了……硲先生也是吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_b:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bc23528103719ebcf83fa5b48ae93a1b630ea0fdb0093add34b0129cf63985f",
      "text": "嗯。当老师的时候，\n虽然也接待过几次毕业生的咨询，不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfde5189760d361452e8da2d6f97a0a5ba0151404b6e64f2b5fbb2e1c7ed1dea",
      "text": "啊，快看快看！\n朝这边走过来的那是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2a51530baf4def0b59a83e431935aa66d0bfbbb8eb1daf984badc82ea7d1a23",
      "text": "啊，是老师们！好久不见！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_b:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47c87ba7fb8d43442b102b4ba1801d2e98edfed0a636b7cf03240a4032b4b49e",
      "text": "各位，好久不见！\n过得还好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_b:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e851a267fc185ffe1be1eb23dc28a5ae63eb17882230c19a083d95ca00186bc9",
      "text": "是的！\n老师们看起来也很精神，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_b:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cd0bb5f5cc686f97c9228ec27e1ea96aaecef910d3ac8180ffb08053c4a11e4",
      "text": "就算当了偶像，\n山下老师的驼背还是没改掉呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_b:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3ad0fd3a0205feb11c41481343516c060d40b91627f14845702c57142314d00",
      "text": "哈哈，可真严格啊。好啦好啦，\n叙旧的事情待会儿再慢慢聊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_b:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ffcdb9f11cd4f7dd3fccc1a0ede2c1b81e3c466e717cdeb11764084dd912d67",
      "text": "唔。大家先去领进校证。\n全员到齐之后，就去校舍后方吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1cb9240ac187be9e1c5699263ffaebab73add517b55614043037acddbb5ee1ac",
      "text": "校舍后方",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c799ca2ea33f6941508129c66966c60f506005c34c12a42beb6c04ceef07b8e",
      "text": "好——勒，赶紧挖吧！\n我记得是埋在这附近了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2abddfbbd73b8f35bc761cb381a8ae297524b7816606ef49989e52b117fbbcb4",
      "text": "Oh！停下停下，预备齐一起挖☆\n比比看谁先找到，是一场race哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e15b4586d596334e6720c0e547e2d63573254bd188053242e8e3156ae60c0500",
      "text": "……哎呀哎呀，类还真是有活力啊。\n我就在这儿参观好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26c5f665c98413573c03250207e1f1d729b5c9fde27031ff791f6d8ec5b05b8d",
      "text": "真是的，快来帮忙啦。老师当了偶像之后，\n体力多少也长进了一点吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1af81cb625dc50fe4fcaab13655236b219542c075aecebd6e2d84088622a0781",
      "text": "哎～这个嘛。我也一把年纪了，\n发育期早就过了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:959f6ff1d4239079dc0a66f6918e2f94b4b09143cb9fddad8a73a2b2a0340e0c",
      "text": "不，山下君通过课程训练，\n确实有所成长。尽管保持自信就好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8d047e348522b9e9f9b8f6a87a5fa010662bbc5b321fe9bc2dcc4315c0b8f73",
      "text": "啊哈哈……当着学生的面被这么说真不好意思。\n总而言之，看来我也稍微有点长进呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff97cc388220d3ddf727cb659d741f6a6e4f8d1e24afbbbd8b2ab7978c41b412",
      "text": "嘿。既然这样……\n老师，你最近赌马赢了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d5de81ca501d0dccd727aa183318bab46fa935041245459c3fdea6a331e4ed6",
      "text": "呃，戳到痛处了啊。赌马这事嘛，\n比起我的长进，主要还是看当下的运气和时机……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:216b0e85c414cd9043e7d4cb3448447fec724f6a8542e799b63beae97a283080",
      "text": "……等等，山下君。\n你连对学生也聊赌博的话题吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a092c4303098cd83491e36ac6994508aaeafd38c70eed6ce99db8212882f83b7",
      "text": "哎呀，那不是过去的事了嘛，过去的事！\n比起那个，类那边情况怎么样了～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_c:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7add8941c8b0a5186ca83181608ea8cab95e399b30fbcd214f1df7eedac0f534",
      "text": "Wow！大家快看，挖出东西来了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e5afa06ce6d3ad6d1b391da1ebe59c6f9e9a04648ec588c19f507db6d0bfbbc",
      "text": "哇啊，好怀念……\n这本漫画，是那时候很火的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:337cffc77f280eec5289ae31f8adbfb04e81a3f44eaf103aaaf00177f627e659",
      "text": "啊，快看。这难道是相册？\n还有修学旅行的照片呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1763c99ff0ddef612125057d1ab21f1a849092b97fd6be03e0c2a366c4ca4982",
      "text": "这张photo上的人，是Mr. 山下？\n相当年轻呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd81858f6c5ab5a11adc6cad99525e5fd15582cef4dffece22203a622d87187f",
      "text": "还好吧？\n说明我也是有过那种年轻气盛的岁月的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c18f9467ba8636e94422fad0a6168cb0212679c9203116cdfd0100e7906ed83",
      "text": "……那个，硲老师。你知道这本笔记本是谁的吗？\n我们大家都没什么印象。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b6ec59791c0af6666b182909bdecf392a0e85a360d4f9f468d968f799f9c17b",
      "text": "唔，让我看看。……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63e9e97dcbefeb2d945f3374fe313a5f05329840d0cf0c2a75e1fe0a47b790a9",
      "text": "Oh……字太多了看得我头晕眼花……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd690f42133f69bd00867c15b864606be18da08bff9aba030d77848ee74e6b6c",
      "text": "教师型机器人硲引领主角成为巨星……\n这是小说？与其说是小说，不如说是电视剧剧本吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3e5bec585afd1aeea21bb2d0997d2bc6c3deb449b9b9616aaf96a0fdf6d3eef",
      "text": "看来是的。\n这个“硲”，指的应该是我吧……嗯？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:327141f90a74fdc5c810d531bea5eb6a362dff5e62f1d19bd98b551d44695320",
      "text": "虽然字迹有些模糊，但这里写着名字。\n我记得他应该是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5748cf4f083f12946109f8a25526c28eed40143041a8538da35f2ea333c1e63b",
      "text": "哦，您知道是谁的笔记本了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d001bb964b5beeff39282cacf03bc63eb618745d761d8ccfadba8868a57642bc",
      "text": "嗯。不过，他今天好像没有过来。\n我记得他就住在附近才对……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_d:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2d47b54e92d41a1c46175e5fc774fda3895be3f0158a22bbb032791cf69afc7",
      "text": "既然这样，那本notebook就由我们去送还给他吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_e:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "数小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:494fb5e31408e5d98cd41fce3d25bcc83d25e80a59a98616481efbe02f905c69",
      "text": "来了，请问是哪位……诶，硲老师！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:82ce4bac01956dd38a7cfc401f6638f7b0d360c549a760f5151d08be56fb9846",
      "text": "好久不见。\n过得还好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_e:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5233da1c985557d1226e96e05eef741f55b647e8a447fd0c0eca7aadb252557d",
      "text": "还、还好，马马虎虎吧……\n话说回来，突然找我有什么事吗……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_e:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76c4ebd2daa98e307398614084fa33baacb66ab7c6e30cf6041bfa80a4e59a0f",
      "text": "我们挖出了时间胶囊，\n里面有一本像是属于你的笔记本，所以特地送过来。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e92c93bfa7a693902deb42a4463eb9580da3c1ef6ce2bde66edb8d15b26090e",
      "text": "我记得你以前的志向是成为作家。\n现在也还在写故事吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55498a7d0428d35feeb49fe6d7a6dd028018ef22c92139caf33ab18a1c8599b0",
      "text": "……！跟你没关系吧。\n东西放下，赶紧回去吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_e:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92d9be65e4cb3099d64098e6f03d17ee93d108ad522dfc4aeee7c518ffc7af95",
      "text": "但是，难得重逢。\n稍微聊一……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd5c9e4d69bed7ff54b2c7e648b3f79fb0d4c470fccd14c8f417046ec4d3d2d4",
      "text": "没什么好聊的！\n特别是跟你这种家伙！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_e:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38bebf5500901d0d1c7d895c27574c71436bbfb9cc00e3350fd4e9f2ccae0b07",
      "text": "……这是什么意思？\n我是说了什么冒犯的话吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c806c20fcfff14c9d5ce74bd3fe2891e2a112724af24b053360d19d91283a549",
      "text": "对，你整个人都很碍眼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_e:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ada009fc7d36bf344dd914fe205863f89de01e54d3b88f24a96aa091324a716a",
      "text": "听说你突然辞职去当了偶像。\n但你跟当老师的时候相比，根本一点都没变。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_e:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2d92ed80e543f33e5af6b71d9e86fe5507f4dba29a4ce9e33459d517ff77a6e",
      "text": "死板的气场、一丝不苟的脸孔、\n还有那让人火大的笔直注视过来的眼神……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_e:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df933b3be947b61152318be1d4d837bbfbeec0e368875fc977666c2c7c39f3ae",
      "text": "我……明明我毕业离开学校之后，\n一切的一切都变了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:77fa3fcdfe8b4e73815f78b4f80adb92d01aa2a1d114de23f3282c1351d98b5e",
      "text": "……原来如此，看来作家的道路很坎坷啊。\n那个啊，虽然我一个外人这么说不太合适。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47159548ae7c6b40fa517676e6941365f447e8ebff1133b3ab71b741abe6d21c",
      "text": "要放弃梦想，现在还太早了吧？\n我和硲先生可都是到了三十多岁才重新起步的哦？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c636cfd64cc86eebe2068a2a6c435a042b5b25ee285bca1a945ffeca2387c150",
      "text": "老师们能做到，是因为你们本来就很特别！\n我又没有……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e617e1ab07ead6db6763ea435fb4907d937808a7db1bbd312c4db9c7b600b9c9",
      "text": "呐，你当初是为什么\n想要成为writer的呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97476e472aff52222674828df381fca7b07cce76c07d5f992017e54a4c9ab6c5",
      "text": "那是因为……\n在写故事的时候，是最快乐的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6114ef02fe7b2197ee09483b8cb999ea219bf4414b91d55bfcd3cd1d722e891f",
      "text": "可是，现在却……只剩下痛苦。\n偏偏我又没办法彻底放弃梦想，所以格外……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da2eeca0c34f64a86bbcb690cdc5043f5652d21a5f6ae5ab5767816b98a37cb9",
      "text": "既然这样，那就再try一次看看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0de079ccbf0afc6f391aa90a2e491bca1f332be0e398945a2877fadafb7be77d",
      "text": "舞田君和山下君说得对。\n朝着梦想，再去挑战一次吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23c1d633fb27cb4f030cddfb0a4fa76190c0651bc997650591280a993cfd4006",
      "text": "我们三人，无论何时都是你的后盾。\n这就是老师所拥有的特殊力量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d22e255954dfa31ff5ac3de420f61d8a63bc66f63cf28b9c554bd89e5ad95945",
      "text": "老师……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48d03e86354463a2bbb2b85d2ee7dfacb8671f3343d6ef0a8291259ca0b1bcc5",
      "text": "……我，决定再试一次。\n在把这个剧本落实成形之前，我要撑下去！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef1d3ea99cbf51fe17ca9070ff61e14d65b72e7834dc0b8b4ee16ff593918886",
      "text": "成形……对了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000121:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d60df5f36f861e667e2e998f35579bb5bf0565135203610d70fedf21d68d034c",
      "text": "由我们来出演他写的script，你觉得怎么样？\n一定会成为非常棒的drama的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000123:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d110dbe77a523f680f18f98d7957319dfa936fbd5d21d6fb39bc5c9bdcf7c0e5",
      "text": "要、要是能那样的话\n我固然会很高兴，可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f60d071a5158a22991785c835843b2dba70d490ad4b94fdd8298060218b13a0",
      "text": "我也觉得这是个好主意。\n首先来跟制作人商量一下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000149:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af57dbacdd25a804fd8ecb2891b22ff3b12f2e5ed145ee38bab734f676f7f830",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，\n突然打电话来，很抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000151:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63d9665fc110d93990e8fef0d3d256ec2b9ca34d52bf87ac774ab64244880a85",
      "text": "实际上，我有个不情之请。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000153:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07714b7d9fa2de84d8dbd1d2ef66dd3f15cbfa1c58fcf86fe0a4502184c15558",
      "text": "我现在在从前的学生家里，\n那个学生写了一部电视剧剧本。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000155:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bfbb2889894a025d264e2e275780f496b75e557278fac6ed14b5a803837449e",
      "text": "这部电视剧，\n能否由我们S.E.M来进行拍摄呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000157:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2140cea09447b8741e43ce5c7d54b18dc746d0b31bb66bf80f1cdc6d315931be",
      "text": "我知道这很突然，\n但我无论如何都想让他的作品化为现实。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000159:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64f92e64e28fc33d29846f95e006be57ac1d42b05cba3474a530af10e8e37152",
      "text": "如果能在我们的频道上播放这部电视剧，\n我想也能引发话题……你觉得如何？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000161:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf689362a644ae6d5970090bbeed9cd256d0e19636b2bea2e3295abf3947311e",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱！\n我也拜托你了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000163:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff2bc29cdde61662b6acf9e97f4f368efee14165478e6ec98b9cc183fb1de1d2",
      "text": "请务必去拍吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000166:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6eb81625a7e18f346b764af6c1ee877887f52c856dc7448a7c0053a1c35cf41",
      "text": "谢谢你。\n详细情况，容我日后再向你汇报。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_f:cmd-000168:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a0ce367874169caff934c7ce0bb72608e1007a8bd7983c9e716fe1c87e3f68b",
      "text": "我这就去告诉我的学生，●●●●プロデューサー已经\n答应了这件事。那么，先挂了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:205b537162a622d6c13223069f400d4e8d55bf55b3cd45c60b78e4ab8e51e99c",
      "text": "拍摄当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e141bfca6cc104d2902f1551c2b8c9f3207943d3ba3bef356dad73b3bf823b4",
      "text": "各位，早上好！\n从今天开始的拍摄，大家一起加油吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e536d62b5dd18aee128c4a7511b99628f14336b658d5a8febc39c0be4ed61457",
      "text": "那是自然。比起那个，制作人，\n听说你从搭建器材阶段就来帮忙了。非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25618c9dfe750d349c3dd8391af7bbdd9cedde07a7c374e11460e91c369067c6",
      "text": "我还听说制作人将担任摄影师掌镜。\n添麻烦了，拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40e19223b4318e50cd1083484db9b6e8cce34fa164ce7035e2134c459185777c",
      "text": "没有的事，请不用介意我。\n比起那个，各位准备充分了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:21b58270b4f91144b1d940db230d4ae4392f489adf59f19e25bd66d42ea4e412",
      "text": "Of course！直到今天我都反复读了好多次script，\n台词全都记熟了哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d263dd6c723d82e1c86249872ab3eb2d1c25a6b13a01ad20c0ea0499f3db846d",
      "text": "从主人公的涂鸦中诞生的fairy，\n教师型robot硲与山下＆舞田！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5901f023cf01f5149952c97375525aeeb054b3648a28051b8c527d0a9a67171f",
      "text": "三位fairy引导主角成为star……\n超级exciting的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fcc4fcd7b599994e8a30d77d42b8da4f03b72bf57f5091b8e2b0136bca32d5b",
      "text": "嘿，除了漫画什么都看不下去的类，\n居然读进剧本了啊。挺厉害的嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bed012b0088a50388913f8b5878e81505d000623c359e56eb55527f75ebcbb7",
      "text": "啊哈哈，感觉看了一辈子份的word呢。\n不过，努力的可不只是我一个人吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1aaaa112a355e5bcdf1f2a3039149f66d132c7f3e46478efd0c2ad644ab436d5",
      "text": "Mr. 硲也在training\nrobot般的动作对吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000115:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b7aaaea9de531256b0321829c0deceb96584d069557718f3f03af20f02db2890",
      "text": "嗯。虽然相当吃力，\n但我想总算是有模有样了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000127:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d20162312af2856058969c2770be25536b1c45f67a7bffccbc602fe925a8bdbd",
      "text": "山下君不也热心地陪着负责担任\n主角的他进行了很多练习吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a3bdc9e3f3798f6a144db1d1b8a28f5f44a46828c531419a291aac58fc481d8b",
      "text": "虽然我没能给出什么了不起的建议就是了……\n这也是为了可爱的学生嘛，开玩笑的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_g:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:34e874a1b902f1171af00e6dc286e8f9c5ffded2d7badbb99ce226e1631b799a",
      "text": "很好……各自都准备充分了。来吧，拼尽全力吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f10f377623d30a2f8e6eef9924c2cd8b7962dcbd80ad5f1e46aca35a570d7f4",
      "text": "录制结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04d7ef92a4c0eba71efdd75293ba598fae1469602d48603808a97e942deebb22",
      "text": "各位，辛苦了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7df8927af04c4d098f3cff48500e1f57264e65aa4c1cc1d83c23c17afed1cb9e",
      "text": "至此，电视剧的拍摄已全部完成。\n总算是告一段落了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e18aa972083fb7aa53f2798b055a721840329e980e12da39e61df68479a6f4f",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー也辛苦了。\n这次拍摄，格外受你关照了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba7682bedb346e618bf43c9757eb8fee6ab314f5d19443a0508a232197ddd2e1",
      "text": "从联系场地，到现场指挥……\n能成为我们的助力，真的很感谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83876a148e21cbf7cb6d6fd17dfcdd7426bc3df1060a2d14f8927bcc666f294a",
      "text": "哪里。作为制作人，\n能够帮上大家的忙真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33f7b5bae8596043696082405fc362478eae346e8ec78afdde918ab59a4d99c9",
      "text": "哎呀，总之大家辛苦了。\n找个时间热热闹闹地开个庆功宴吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a811d6d30ab0d6743c62e3e1133c2e89b03d464de5388d97363967bf97431b3",
      "text": "Nice idea！带上●●●●プロデューサー酱，\n去Mr. 山下家里开party吧☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85d3f6696029c50fb710dacedf80b796ede464449c2d387fd42c6f534ec23b2a",
      "text": "喂喂，场地定在我的房间啊……\n虽然也不是不行啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1220dc7a21679694973316faa69dfcc2618f75a9c17bfae6c4d2b45e1b14d2b5",
      "text": "……老师们，是货真价实的偶像啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15bed5bb3717267821ffb214971730771ee927f3a2e1e0e464caaddff8a8b9ae",
      "text": "而且……无论何时，都是我的老师。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000111:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c4ad222d3a06dbf9a5341f55abbaf898d8ca57bad464c7564b421bc579bb6fa",
      "text": "杀青了，\n辛苦各位了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000114:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7fdb37b6d82688f024bb2140747fd5ce1d1134fb01a31497bec9377aff6697d",
      "text": "辛苦啦\n我已经累得精疲力竭了",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000116:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f051bd08c90f7fdc1361e97e30f7ee9ea487863f881bf49664649a59ef2ae1b",
      "text": "虽然拍摄很Hard\n但我玩得很开心哦<emoji>image_talk_emoji_16</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000118:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1beabaaecc0f9752b0501f82f8ea15e426996d8790c4e80dfa40537de75574d",
      "text": "这一次的拍摄，由于有很多不习惯的\n事情，相对地也学到了\n很多东西。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000120:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91cf1f908f9802f443e56bef60732608a0cf08671ba13a037e4b58f3a341fb9f",
      "text": "在今后的活动中，\n好好加以应用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000122:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18554282740f06f9b6a7c9ca17110cccca83dcb2eb94611426458ecbc5187273",
      "text": "硲先生可真认真啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000124:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd27e491f08693e30d756c8890ed747e278430f20a8df556418aa5c85200051a",
      "text": "像我，就只有拍摄顺利\n结束的安心感而已哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_h:cmd-000126:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a71c0ac1d4ae7cc215664093d77443f64d551ae7318ed661717787ca1e89e65",
      "text": "接下来就只要怀着期待\n等待drama完成了呢<emoji>image_talk_emoji_24</emoji>",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_i:cmd-000021:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6609af65db2587d70f89eb587463686af3bdd42385789ee63adaad32e78f904",
      "text": "《涂鸦老师》",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_i:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e1327bd1ead656a69c43f45a4488f4b66bf0bcc20d8804c0c1a53e58a54e3b3",
      "text": "……大家，变回涂鸦的时刻终于到了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_i:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b858422868e1fd502d086edda6a076dc9e01941d597bf6245c8a22953bc3574",
      "text": "是啊。但是，换作现在的你已经没问题了。\n成为了巨星的你，应该已经注意到了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_i:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4315ac51527045b91ca862d4e3a18801fa0362ce8451ace8d542231948e2319",
      "text": "梦想，会给自己的整个人生施加魔法。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a51d15afde7b039d3395eea55f188097fe509ac8d43e90cc02cc058299c35bb",
      "text": "对眼中所见的一切事物，都——感到兴奋雀跃。\n对无论什么事情，都会萌生想要了解的兴趣。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_i:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50e1ecc08ee617dc1a8f8745f2d31bc25e622ea9c959c1d6f0c7d31429c6c84e",
      "text": "梦想，能让你每天都全身心投入！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_i:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f23f1d0176dad4eaf7392d6ba624df0717495e20a986435cb058d1d97c5c415",
      "text": "你想起了梦想的可贵。\n所以我们，才能放心地变回原样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0bda5feeaf889411e02bf890e857ee3434d50ee39d973f0fd87754f70278449",
      "text": "但是，若是迷失了方向，\n只要再次呼唤我们即可。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_i:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:662664e6b59808f8cec3089c698305e0696afb05c6328997f063066013ffed35",
      "text": "我们，不论何时都在守护着你！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_i:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8171047f91d3bc75cd9a70f7c3f3e181a67e4e9029459e48e8e69728fc0b7c8c",
      "text": "……大家，谢谢你们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_i:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92e0758c18fe218a3635bd97ab0cc01a0bdb81b575aa73b9c1d71e2539ba2354",
      "text": "你们教会我的东西，我绝对不会忘记的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36c39a6e425c0c41ba11d74816336a2e18b89800e21a402afa8a7092964584fa",
      "text": "Wonderful！\n非常exciting的drama呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:157fef80f0c3dcda8edafe426c0e48ed3f3a5aacf6ca97b9039a03aa964e711f",
      "text": "嗯。想必他也一定会感到高兴吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4c63d124b4dc11a93e35d5561a17f31d349d96885d2f39a0f71a6bfb1967e0f",
      "text": "虽然每天每天都在背台词和拍摄，\n挺辛苦的……不过这番努力很值得呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e86d23809785de3b786bc7d5f5ab5d14bed9f96c1a458d8d867912e2537cb156",
      "text": "说起来，我有好好找到\n●●●●プロデューサー酱出场的地方哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02ff6ade000c5fd82a2d764eff9b93c03c367586df9223d1e9bcd4f969b54f9a",
      "text": "啊哈哈，亏你能注意到呢。\n因为人手不够，我只是以配角客串了一个镜头而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53f5851d210c7a0d81d9fab8605bbbb1abdb2138074cc313a927523534fd7484",
      "text": "……咦。最后一个镜头，好像有一条留言\n呢。这个，难道不是写给各位的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bd92592780ad06ea043aeb869de3161867666271b2487c3e8bb2b6625f9c844",
      "text": "哎？呃……\n“无惧失败，不畏挫折，勇往直前”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2610ea6c4dbd953799a0010cbedebd35f2facb5e76ba75cf1aa995c5f963afe2",
      "text": "“因为这一定会化为迈向梦想的一步”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d256a19c96ef9cf2113160254cc430f684cd4771705c63edd771ea3c9dea0db3",
      "text": "“谨向再次赋予我这份勇气的\n老师们，致以最诚挚的感谢”……吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:784eb19b10a980aa57569136f80d488fe4aef89591b7f4f0336f160e49ce1c90",
      "text": "……看来作为偶像，我们切实地\n引领了他啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_k:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0181ebda5eb0474fe89a98f5f08a965bb45dc81f760c8cbc0e9ecf53088ff624",
      "text": "（多亏了老师们，我再次涌出了\n追逐梦想的勇气）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_k:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:74f0a6e5632c1361114394c8fdce75aedb2f2958104641eb858d33fcd689bb7b",
      "text": "（我也要追随主角的脚步。\n这一次，我绝不会放弃，一定要实现梦想！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_k:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ddfedb6c3240d4bb1061681d09ff3cbb25856080068778ac7443d2e4823e2dc",
      "text": "打、打扰了！\n我是今天预约面试的片石！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_k:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eed9752dcb5dd0f214f99b32b1ab2998826c6d99fff1bdcaa080bbfc7d5c1d31",
      "text": "想必，他一定没问题了。\n应该已经重新迈向了自己的梦想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_k:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9794b9c2a0c58d65d0331c7ce72427167d5ab823a6875e6284eb360a51035985",
      "text": "是啊。从刚才的留言来看，\n烦恼似乎也烟消云散了。太好啦太好啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_k:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dac4821d237c01ddbbdd7557116d2fe80e30d07fed3b7a83ba500e917e0a961f",
      "text": "……呵。看来成为偶像确实没有\n选错路呢。舞田君、山下君！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_k:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97d1c9e72b98c328237368a9ba74015eea3132258ab04984bf0b93b72be06f4e",
      "text": "为了今后也能指引学生们迈向光明的未来，\n我们也要更加精进！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_k:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22f68a731a613bcf6192e38f8e4cfe1678f3d04a0cbb2e6daf46d4022eb9e3cd",
      "text": "Wow！Mr. 硲，整个人闪闪发光呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_k:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec7a71ba454cd5fde19b3dd3fd15ceaeaf6a0c5d00519413654dbd54ead6e4a2",
      "text": "与其说闪闪发光，不如说变得更加充满压迫感了\n吧……不过，今后我也会奉陪到底的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_k:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65db95ce3ce60f93c8f9e3f663b37d981151aa87d7685009eaa89428e319d3a9",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n今后也拜托你多多关照我们了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_k:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef1476153c3a896d09ace55533bd4d9f81b3140e9156cad13560641f205191b5",
      "text": "好的！我这边才要请各位多多关照！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
